# FUN_00436c9d: fleeing. Offline, DAT_00502b14 is 0 for an ordinary encounter and the Tactics
# abandon dialog (FUN_00447431) returns 0, so the hero is NEVER given a timer escape: pressing F
# while its combatant is still 0x2F is refused outright with "You attempt to flee... but are
# dragged back".
#
# The only way out is the original's 30 % interrupt, and that window is narrower than it looks.
# FUN_00436c9d returns "blocked" on its first test whenever the hero's own record is 0x2F, and
# FUN_00490723 sets 0x2F on whichever combatant acted. So after the hero attacks, every later F in
# that round is refused before the roll is ever reached; the roll is only live while a MONSTER's
# attack is animating on the hero and the hero has not yet acted in that round. Hence: never press
# A here, just keep pressing F and let the monsters swing.
#
# FUN_0041B891's own table (all.c:21078) has THREE states before the Well, not two:
#   1 main menu -> 2 "Where Do You Want To Play Today?" (splash, art\where.jpg, FUN_0041D31F)
#   2 -> 3 "Choose Your World" + the world list (art\chapter.jpg, FUN_0041D717)
#   3 -> take the highlighted row (msg 0x474) -> the Pick-a-Soul window
# RETURN is the plan's keyboard shortcut for the click.
expect boot_menu 900
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text Tester
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
hold RIGHT 60
keydown DOWN
expect battle_start 1500
keyup DOWN
# Refused: the hero has not acted, so rec[0x38C] is still 0x2F and FUN_00436c9d returns blocked
# on its first test, before DAT_00502b14 or the 30 % roll are ever consulted.
key f
expect battle_flee_failed 300
# Poll F through the monsters' attack animations until the 30 % roll lets go.
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
key f
wait 4
